# DIAGNOSTICS

It exits with 1, logging `preferences: FAILED:` and why, for an unknown area, or when it can't reach Radharc.

# BUGS

Nothing yet reads Keyboard's and Mouse's settings: kbdfs(4) doesn't repeat keys, and Radharc moves the pointer at one speed.
Appearance has no Edit and no Save as theme: roles are set over the theme only through radharc(4)'s `theme/ctl`.
A choice is labelled with its value, not a name for it.
